{
  "name": "harvestman",
  "_about": "A harvestman (Phalangium opilio), the body 7 mm long and the legs 5 cm: one round body with no waist, slung low between eight immensely long thin legs that arch high over it -- the second pair the longest, waved as feelers; a turret on top with a dark eye each side; small chelicerae and palps in front; greyish brown with a darker saddle, pale below. Not a spider: one body, two eyes, no silk, no venom. Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/bugs.py on insectlib.py (jointed legs on a walking gait, the antennae on bones of their own that wave).",
